{"strongs": "H6903", "word": "ᵑ7", "translit": "qe.vel", "root": "צבע", "morph": "A:Prep", "pos": "substantive", "gloss": "front, as", "definition": "קֳבֵל 29 substantive front, as preposition in front of, before, because of ; followed by דִּי as conjunction because that (perhaps in form a diminutive, Bev Dan 2:8 ; ᵑ7 קְבֵיל , with לְ , לִקְבֵיל , suffix לְקִבֵלִי , etc., in front of ( Dalm § 47, 7 ); Syriac , aspect , in front , , suffix in front (of), opposite (to) , compare Gen 15:10 ᵑ7 ᵑ6 ; Palmyrene לקבל before ( Cooke 321 , compare193)); — construct לָקֳבֵל Dan 2:8 +, suffix לְקָבְלָךְ Dan 2:31 — 1. with לְ \\ \\ a. Dan 3:3 צַלְמָא ׳ לק before the image , Dan 2:31 ; Dan 5:1 ; Dan 5:5 in view of, by reason of , Dan 5:10 מַלְכָּא ׳ מִלֵּ ׳ לק by reason of the words, etc., Ezra 4:16 לָקֳבֵל דְּנָה (compare Egyptian Aramaic לקבל זנה זי , RES 361 B5 ). \\ \\ b. followed by דִּי as conjunction because that Ezra 6:13 (so Palmyrene CIS ii. 164 ). 2. with כֹּל , כָּלקֳֿבֵל in view of, because of (but read probably כְּלָקֳבֵל according to the front of , i.e. having regard to, because of : Luzz Chald. Gr. § 123 Lambert RÉJ, 1895, 47 f. Marti § 95 d Nö LCB, 1896, 703 Nes OLZ, 1902, 487 Str 56 and others; compare Biblical Hebrew I. עֻמָּה d ): \\ \\ a. as preposition כָּלקֳֿבֵל דְּנָה because of this, therefore , Dan 2:12 ; Dan 2:24 ; Dan 3:7 ; Dan 3:8 ; Dan 6:10 ; Ezra 7:17 ; Dan 3:22 pointing forwards, ׳ כָּלקֳֿבֵל דִּנָה דִּנָה מִןדִּֿי וג on this account , (namely) because that, etc. \\ \\ b. followed by דִּי as conjunction because that, inasmuch as , Dan 2:8 כָּלקֳֿבֵל (כְּלָקֳבֵל) דִּי חֲזֵיתוּן because ye see, v Dan 2:10 v Dan 2:41 v Dan 2:45 +, Ezra 4:14 ; Ezra 7:14 ; Dan 5:22 = although. In Dan 2:40 ; Dan 6:11 taken by ᵐ5 ( ὂν τρόπον , καθώς ), Ges ( Thes , not Lex), Ew Hi as = according as (as Eccl 5:15 ᵑ7 כל קבל דאתא according as he came), but not Bev Behrm Marti . [Occasionally in ᵑ7 , usually = before ; compare in ᵑ7 J Gen 28:17 ; Gen 31:32 , D §§ 47.7; 50 ]."