 47 f.</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Marti')\">Marti<sup>§ 95 d</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>LCB, 1896, 703</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nes')\">Nes<sup>OLZ, 1902, 487</sup></lookup> Str<sup>56</sup> and others; compare Biblical Hebrew I.  <bdbheb><reflink>עֻמָּה</reflink></bdbheb> <b>d</b>): <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> as <b>preposition</b> <bdbarc>כָּלקֳֿבֵל דְּנָה</bdbarc> <highlight>because of this, therefore</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Dan 2:12\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,12)\">Dan 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,24)\">Dan 2:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,7)\">Dan 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:8\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,8)\">Dan 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 6:10\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,10)\">Dan 6:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:17\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,17)\">Ezra 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:22\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,22)\">Dan 3:22</ref> pointing forwards, <bdbarc>׳</bdbarc><bdbarc>כָּלקֳֿבֵל דִּנָה דִּנָה מִןדִּֿי וג</bdbarc> <highlight>on this account</highlight>, (namely) because that, etc. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> followed by <bdbarc>דִּי</bdbarc> as <b>conjunction</b> <highlight>because that, inasmuch as</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Dan 2:8\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,8)\">Dan 2:8</ref> <bdbarc>כָּלקֳֿבֵל (כְּלָקֳבֵל) דִּי חֲזֵיתוּן</bdbarc> <highlight>because</highlight> ye see, v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:10\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,10)\">Dan 2:10</ref> v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:41\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4